{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "aed98f10-fb6d-801a-9b86-56a1d7748e51",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T11:27:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, Sheila Kearney. I'm calling for my mother. When I was a kid down by the harbor, the streetlights were the only thing that told us to get home. Now one of them won't quit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It flickers on and off all night. On, off, on, off. It's right in my mother's bedroom window. She's barely slept since last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:26:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, flickering overnight, started after the storm. Where's the pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:26:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four twenty-nine Ruggles Avenue, up on the Hill. It's the pole right out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:26:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four twenty-nine Ruggles. Okay. Can you hear me alright? You sound a little far away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, that's my headphones. They're paired to the wrong device, so I'm half in the phone and half in the tablet. Hang on. Better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:26:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Much better, thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So can you send a crew to check the pole? It's wicked annoying, honestly, and it's been going for days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:26:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a work order for a crew to look at the pole and the fixture. Usually that's within a few days to a week. Do you want a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:27:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:27:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one eight five, got it. All set, Sheila."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kevin. Appreciate it."
    }
  ],
